00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:39,000
I have learned the scout master position,

171
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
which is one hand in your pocket

172
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,000
and the other holding a cup of coffee.

173
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:45,000
How about you, Larry?

174
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:49,000
I think I'm way more patient than I was when I started-

175
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Less flappable, more unflappable, I think the term-

176
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:59,000
