182
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,000
and you'll take care of, like his son.

183
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,000
And Larry, what was your experience?

184
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:22,000
My guys and I, I don't think, had a problem with that.

185
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
I've asked them about that.

186
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
They're both fairly independent

187
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
and they both had good friends in the troop

188
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,000
