189
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:31,000
I did a few of their scout master conferences.

190
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:34,000
some other assistant scout masters did them.

191
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:37,000
I think it worked out pretty well.

192
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,000
Walter, what was your experience?

193
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,000
Well, when I was asked to be scout master,

194
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,000
I asked my son about it

195
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:45,000
and he thought it was a terrible idea.

196
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:50,000
He came around and in fact he was SPL

197
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,000
and I was scout master.

198
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,000
That worked out pretty well.

199
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
but it was really nice to have

200
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,000
hand that over to another scout master-

201
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,000
and he was still SPL

202
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:00,000
and let me be able to see them work together.

203
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
So patients, having a little bit of

204
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,000
you, end up having those things that you do as a father

205
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:09,000
and those things that you do as a scout master

206
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,000
and that can be kind of fuzzy at times.

207
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,000
It can be kind of hard to figure.

208
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
What challenges do you expect

209
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,000
a new scout master is going to meet,

210
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
Sometimes trying to do

211
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,000
I can do it better myself

212
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:24,000
or it won't get done. right if I don't do it-

